    "body": "Starship can already do this.\r\n\r\nI tried to verify.\r\n```\r\n$ mkdir /tmp/265 && cd /tmp/265\r\n$ touch foo.rb\r\n$ rbenv local 2.6.5\r\n```\r\n<img width=\"249\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2020-03-10 at 16 15 15\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/12455284/76288568-5e2b8080-62ea-11ea-92cc-113a813d41be.png\">\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ mkdir /tmp/270 && cd /tmp/270\r\n$ touch foo.rb\r\n$ rbenv local 2.7.0\r\n```\r\n\r\n<img width=\"188\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2020-03-10 at 16 16 29\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/12455284/76288664-98951d80-62ea-11ea-9ee4-e9bd5e4b48e1.png\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
