    "body": "Maybe something about your local setup is odd? This is working as expected for me when manually updating the `.ruby-version` file:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\ntest via ⬢ v13.10.1 via 💎 v2.7.0\r\n➜ echo '2.1.10' > .ruby-version\r\ntest via ⬢ v13.10.1 via 💎 v2.1.1\r\n➜ echo '2.7.0' > .ruby-version\r\ntest via ⬢ v13.10.1 via 💎 v2.7.0\r\n➜\r\n```\r\n",
